+ * nvk_cmd_dirty_cbufs_for_descriptors_delta and dynamic_buffers_valid /
+ * dynamic_starts_valid), with the same algorithm the previous port patch had: only the
+ * dynamic_buffers words that change or were not yet sent in this command buffer
